          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. Costs and gotchas",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Kills even distribution — hot clients pin to one node forever",
            "Blocks clean draining: you cannot move a session, only kill it",
            "One backend dies = **visible** session loss for its users",
            "Scale-in kills sessions; scale-out helps {red:nobody} already bound",
            "'Zombie' imbalance: old nodes saturated for hours, new ones idle",
            "Silent affinity hides real imbalance until a deploy exposes it"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "In-flight multipart upload buffered on disk",
            "Long-lived websocket or SSE stream",
            "Per-connection cache too costly to rebuild",
            "Legacy app you cannot modify"
          ],
          "style": "star"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "Stamp",
          "text": "Never source-IP affinity for public mobile traffic. Cookie affinity only when you cannot externalize."
        },
